{
  "slug": "urc",
  "name": "Urc",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Control Codex and Gemini from the Claude app on your phone. URC spawns a lightweight Haiku relay that bridges your phone's Remote Control session to any Codex or Gemini pane running in tmux. One app, three AI ecosystems. Also includes a cross-CLI teams protocol for structured agent-to-agent communication via MCP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent**, **3 hooks** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `urc` (Bridge any Codex or Gemini pane to the Claude Code phone app — auto-detects CLI type)\n- **Agents** (1): `rc-bridge` (Dumb passthrough relay between Claude Code phone app and a Codex/Gemini pane)\n- **Hooks** (3): `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `urc-coordination`, `codex`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install urc@claude-community` from `siddharthkandan/universal-remote-control`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 3,
    "mcp": 2
  },
